# The I/L's second class node: a wall of eight lightning bolts that moves across
# the screen, each bolt striking fifteen times for 860% at max.
#
# All eight hit. GMS gives the wall two invisible attack objects, one moving and
# one locked in place, and each has the full `mobCount 12`, `attackCount 15` and
# `380+16x`, so an enemy the wall passes over takes all eight. 103,200% at max,
# and its rate over the cooldown almost exactly matches Spear of Darkness:
# 2,580%/s against 2,589%/s.
#
# Twelve enemies is GMS's own mobCount, and this game's hitbox rule gets the
# same from the bolt's 300x610 box: floor(300/70) * (1 + floor(610/250)) = 12.
#
# `cast_interval_ms` is GMS's `subTime`: the bolts land one at a time, 210ms
# apart, so each hits what the one before left standing. Nothing here has a
# position, so the wall clearing twelve and moving to the next twelve is what
# moving across the screen means here.
#
# Dropped: the recast that locks the wall in place, which needs a place; and
# immunity to attack reflection, which nothing here has.
name: "Bolt Barrage"
description:
  "Summons a wall of lightning that pulses forward, electrocuting enemies in "
  "its path."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_LIGHTNING
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE_V skill_order: 2 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 660
cooldown_seconds: 40.0
max_enemies: 12
lines: 15
casts: 8
cast_interval_ms: 210
base { skill_pct: 3.96 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.16 }
